Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=12}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:59.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] You just never learn, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:02.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Let go! I'll pay you\Nlater... any way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:03.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:05.55,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] You made a boy cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:06.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] He made me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:09.65,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOTHER] Oh, it's okay.\NKids will be kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:11.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] He said your tangerines suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:12.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] He what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:13.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOTHER] Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:16.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Never give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:23.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You must find the strength\Ninside you to always move on...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:26.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You must live through every moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:34.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] And if you can\Nsmile in the face of it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:37.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,that is the greatest strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:43.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(0,2354)}[NAMI, NOJIKO] Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:49.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While I'm in charge,\Nthose without money will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:52.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand me, you worms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:55.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:02:58.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A map?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:02:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's my map!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:03.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I drew it. You can't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A child drew this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:05.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Hmmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:11.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:14.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] She could be useful.\NBring her with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:15.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:20.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Waaaah! No! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:22.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let her go! Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You promised not to hurt her\Nif you got your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, I won't hurt her,\Njust borrow her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:31.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kuroobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo! Genzo! Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:44.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll... I'll save you, Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, please...! It's okay...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't need to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:02.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I will... save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:09.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Please, no more killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:21.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] All of our ships\Nhave been sunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:28.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm afraid our plan to have Nami and\NNojiko escape to the sea was... a bad plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Marines won't\Nbother trying to save us...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've lost our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere knew that\Nthis would happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:40.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Her experiences in the Marines taught her\Nwhat all these creatures are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:44.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She knew that none of us would escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO sobs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.23,0:04:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They've taken Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:54.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] We know where\NArlong and his crew are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're going to settle\Nright here on this island...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can fight to the death right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or we can take a chance\Nthat the Marines will someday
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:15.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,come to save us and hope and pray\Nwe don't get killed before then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Only Marine headquarters\Nstands a chance against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:23.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they have their hands\Nfull with the Grand Line...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:28.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The chances that they would come all the\Nway out here for us are as good as zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:31.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I can't just sit here\Nand abandon Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:32.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:36.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:40.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand by and do\Nnothing when a child is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now who else will come fight beside us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care if they kill me,\NI'm going to save that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER 3] Bellemere gave her life\Nfor those girls, we should do no less!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:49.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER 4] Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER 5] If just one of us fights,\Nthey'll blame us all, so let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:03.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER 1] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER 2] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:05.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER 3] You're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:09.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami, Nami...! Are you okay...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they hurt you any?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:15.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'm... joining them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:21.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:23.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'm joining Arlong's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll get to be a\Nnavigator and draw maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:30.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:34.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh... What in the world\Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:36.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stand back...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they threaten to do\Nsomething terrible to you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:41.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:42.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They must have done something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:43.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:46.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:47.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:48.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:55.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... that's an... Arlong tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:58.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:04.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at this... They\Ngave me all this money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:10.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh heh... They say...\Nthey'll buy me anything I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you\Nif you join them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They killed Bellemere in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She died to keep us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you! Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:26.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to live like\NBellemere if it just gets you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:29.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] How could you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:37.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Bellemere...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere gave her life so that you\Nand I could go on living... together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:42.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] That's enough, Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave us, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never set foot in this village again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How could she betray\Nher family like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:05.63,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,For money?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:08.09,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere was like her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami loved Bellemere...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I know she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:32.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:38.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Didn't Bellemere always say...\N"Good things will come your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:42.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as long as you continue to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:44.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lots of good things."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:53.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI] After Arlong took me, I watched him\Nsink five Marine ships like they were toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:55.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think they'll send any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:00.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I decided I'd do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:04.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made a deal with Arlong to\Nbuy Cocoyashi Village from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Buy Cocoyashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] For 100 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I buy the town, we'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one else will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And all I have to do is join\Nhis crew and draw maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] But 100 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.39,0:09:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't earn that\Nworking your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.93,0:09:28.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I will get\Nthat money no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,People are having a hard enough time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,paying their own tribute\Nso I have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:37.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If anyone tries to help me,\Nthey'll just get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Won't it be hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Living with the\Npeople who killed our mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just smile\Nevery time I see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] To make a choice like that\Nwhen you're only ten years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:28.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard\Nthat must have been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All to save the\Nvillage she loved so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoever makes Nami suffer's\Ngoing to hear from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because... I'm telling\Nyou to stay out of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:47.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you go around saying\Nthat she's your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they're going to become\Nsuspicious of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:53.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then her eight years of suffering\Nwill have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't make it harder\Nthan it already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She has to fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Knowing there are people who call\Nher "friend" only makes the suffering worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:19.62,FlashbacksSecondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2}[PIRATE A] Get back here, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:20.78,FlashbacksSecondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[PIRATE B] Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] A pirate thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:26.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:29.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing this place has going for\Nit is plenty of pirates to steal from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:31.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'm gonna make 'em pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:33.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] You're all cut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:36.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Yeah, I kinda screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:38.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But look, one million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:39.35,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Who cares about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:40.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:43.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] It's nothing,\Nthese cuts are nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:46.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] No one will find it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:48.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll save up little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:53.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,By the time this is filled,\NI'll have my hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.82,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Still a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:03.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] 100 million berries...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:09.46,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's taken a while,\Nbut only seven million left...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:11.75,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can get that with one more job...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:15.67,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Just one more trip and\Nthis will finally be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:18.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong's rule will be over...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:20.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi Village will be free...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:25.56,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I will be free... and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:31.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And then I think I'll finally\Nbe able to smile again for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.27,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:53.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] So why do the Marines want Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] Your job\Nis to lead the way, quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:00.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hat pinwheel...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:03.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where in the world did he get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:15.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One more little job... Let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.85,0:13:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI thinking]\NGenzo...? And the Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you the pirate thief known as Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Marines' sources have revealed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}that you have quite a large sum of treasure\Nthat you've stolen from pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:40.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The government hereby\Nconfiscates everything you've stolen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:43.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is required that\Nyou comply immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to warn you once...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the leaders\Nof the Arlong Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you mess with me,\NArlong won't sit by quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chichichi... Silly girl...\NWho do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:13:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think\Nyou can intimidate me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:01.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Find the stolen goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think this is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:20.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what the Marines should be doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:22.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Arlong Pirates are murderers;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:25.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they've destroyed entire cities\Nand you're doing nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's ruling over this island and\Ntrampling over people's lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd ignore Arlong's atrocities\Nto steal from a thief...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:34.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what you stand for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:38.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chichichi... Big talk\Nfrom a filthy criminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:39.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha... Continue the search, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every person on this\Nisland has been waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for the Marines to come\Nand help them for years!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.85,0:14:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you pass them by and\Ncome here searching for money!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:49.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C] Colonel...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This tangerine orchard\Nseems a little suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:52.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] Dig it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whole thing if need be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:56.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep your filthy hands
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,off Bellemere's tangerine orchard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take my money...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:06.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That money's for... It's for...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:12.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That poor girl's money is meant\Nto save Cocoyashi Village...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to take\Nour salvation away from her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:16.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A mere village representative\Ntalking down to a Marine colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Genzo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've always known... Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:39.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I couldn't believe\Nwhat you had done...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:41.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I confronted Nojiko about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:44.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since then, everyone\Nhas known that you stayed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with the Arlong Pirates so\Nthat you could save the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we all agreed we'd\Nnever tell you that we knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:55.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you ever thought the villagers\Nwere placing their hopes on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:58.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you might never leave his gang\Nfor fear of letting us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:00.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now hold on a minute, just what\Nare you trying to say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that the\Nvillagers are thieves,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we should arrest\Nevery one of them...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:16.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NOJIKO] What he's saying is that every\Nlast one of us is fighting to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:18.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] We have to fend for ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:20.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because we can't rely on support\Nfrom you government people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:24.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So if you're not gonna protect our\Nvillage, then get the hell outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:28.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And be quick about it,\Nor Arlong'll sink your ship too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong will...? I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still haven't found it...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:40.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're looking for 100 million\Nberries here, not a grain of rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:43.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you know how much there is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just have a hunch that that's\Nthe amount we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:09.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was Arlong that sent you, wasn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:14.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chichichi... 'Course not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do a pirate's\Ndirty work, that'd be wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:22.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm just a public servant dealing with\Ntheft the way any government worker would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:23.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You corrupt Marine scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:28.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Marines have stooped to being\Nnothing but pirate cronies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI thinking] Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:32.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE G] Sir, I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:45.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must say I'm impressed you\Ngathered this much treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:48.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The money's all ragged and bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter... Money's money!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Chichichichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:56.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[thinking] Thirty percent\Nof this is all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Don't touch that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that... Don't touch that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it... Don't touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:08.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:25.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:33.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko! Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Doctor! Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Genzo! What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:45.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Nojiko's been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:46.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] By who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] The Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] The Marines?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:19:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami...! What's up?!\NNeed help with anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.73,0:19:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay outta my business...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:08.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just get away from our island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:16.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI thinking]\NArlong...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:18.39,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet it's the village...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You want it left alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:24.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Gather up 100 million berries,\Nthen bring it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:28.59,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Do so and I will let your village go\Nin addition to giving you your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:30.27,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm the kind of fishman
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,who would rather die than break\Nan agreement concerning money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:38.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't even care how long it takes\Nyou, I will honor our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:41.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:50.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP] Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:52.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:58.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What seems to be the problem,\NO skilled surveyor of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:00.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why the sour face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Those Marine maggots you keep\Non the payroll stole every last berry I had!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.59,0:20:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to all\Nthat crap about dying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:11.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before you'd ever break a promise\Nwhen it comes to money...?! Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Refresh my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:13.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I break a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:17.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that you teamed up\Nwith the Marines to...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just when did I break that promise...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.73,0:20:22.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speak up, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:28.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:31.75,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:34.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI thinking] Damn you...\NDamn you! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:39.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too bad... All your\Nstolen money got stolen...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:41.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That certainly is unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:43.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But a deal is a deal, Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.65,0:20:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you can't come up with 100 million berries,\Nthen both you and your village stay
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in my possession indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you know the terms. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:53.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:56.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only 100 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:01.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Start saving again and\Nyou'll have it in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:04.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or are you gonna run out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you do that, I'll kill\Neveryone in that village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:18.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:21.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We agreed we would never\Ntell you that we knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:25.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If you thought all of us were counting\Non you, you would be bound by guilt
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.73,0:21:28.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,935)}never to leave his gang\Nfor fear of letting us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:36.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww... Running away so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:41.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we chase after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:44.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] No need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:46.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Hachi, she's\Nnot going anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:51.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There's no way Nami could just abandon\Nthe lives of all those villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:55.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOO] Choo. Now that's\Nwhat I call playing dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:59.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd let go of\Nan asset like Nami that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:02.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may be cruel but\NI'm not totally heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:09.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Once she's done charting all the world's\Noceans, she'll have her freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.26,0:22:15.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pretty harsh, man,\Nit'll take decades for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.37,0:22:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet a hundred\Nyears wouldn't be enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:28.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've had enough...! Take up arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.86,0:22:29.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:35.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI thinking]\NGenzo! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:38.75,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:42.80,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to live or our\Nstruggles will mean nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:45.14,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't throw your lives away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Eight long years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:50.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We promised we wouldn't\Nlive our lives in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter the pain or humiliation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we endured under Arlong, we\Nswore to fight the long fight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:58.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so Nami could meet their demands!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:23:00.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, they lied!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.41,0:23:03.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They never intended to\Nkeep their end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.21,0:23:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Instead they stole our\Nonly chance at freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:07.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should make those filthy fishmen pay
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:12.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for the years they manipulated\Nthat kind young girl...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER E] Yeah! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.87,0:23:17.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER H] We were always ready\Nto fight those monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.77,0:23:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:22.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to show those lousy stinkin'\Nfishmen what we're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.01,0:23:24.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.18,0:23:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Everybody! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.18,0:23:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.27,0:23:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.61,0:23:33.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.71,0:23:35.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not that much money...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can make it back in no time...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.41,0:23:40.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:43.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy... this time!\NI'm used to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine! Just relax!\NEverything is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... It's nothing\Ncompared to back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:54.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay...!\NYou don't need to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:56.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:58.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.14,0:24:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've done enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:07.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to know\Nthat there is no point now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You struggled so hard, carrying our\Nlives on your back this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:16.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine that joining\Nthem must have been more painful,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.45,0:24:18.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than being stabbed through the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:22.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] You fought very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.22,0:24:25.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Genzo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.14,0:24:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Set yourself free from this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:35.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.02,0:24:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.65,0:24:39.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] What?! Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.71,0:24:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:42.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.88,0:24:45.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are an exceptional young woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.65,0:24:46.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.21,0:24:48.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:51.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:53.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stay right there...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.52,0:24:57.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let anyone\Nelse get hurt by these monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.86,0:25:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll all die...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.86,0:25:03.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:12.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami... It's no use,\Nwe've made up our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.16,0:25:17.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.91,0:25:21.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.30,0:25:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] We may not win\Nbut we will give 'em hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:31.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cheers]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.51,0:25:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI sobs]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.74,0:25:54.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:05.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:11.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong! Arlong! Arlong! Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.34,0:26:14.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong! Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.97,0:26:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arl–!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.31,0:26:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.59,0:26:27.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.93,0:26:29.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You don't know what's been happening\Non this island for the past eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:35.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Nope. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.04,0:26:37.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.92,0:26:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep... You sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.97,0:26:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] So leave...!\NI told you to leave...!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.34,0:26:49.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out of here...!\NGet out of here now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go...! Go away...! Go...! Go...! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.82,0:27:10.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.61,0:27:22.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Of course...\NThat's what friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.39,0:27:31.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You better keep your hands off my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.22,0:27:42.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:46.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:52.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Hey!\NAre you guys all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:54.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Did Arlong do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.69,0:27:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Move aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:28:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have business to take\Ncare of with the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.32,0:28:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When we finally found out\Nthe truth about Big Sis Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.09,0:28:07.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We realized the only thing we could\Ndo was defeat Arlong in battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.55,0:28:10.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So we decided to come back\Nhere and challenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.41,0:28:12.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Then we lost,\Nbut only by a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:17.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't\Nlet you through this door...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:19.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no chance of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.42,0:28:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.26,0:28:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be patient...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.16,0:28:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.33,0:28:24.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, we're waiting for\Nthe arrival of certain men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:26.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What "certain men"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.03,0:28:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.03,0:28:31.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll be here soon...\NI'd bet my life on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.85,0:28:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.72,0:28:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.06,0:29:00.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think those two idiots\Nthat showed up earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are members of Zoro's little crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.93,0:29:05.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro? They seemed too weak for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.73,0:29:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They weren't even worth killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.37,0:29:08.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.37,0:29:11.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:12.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.92,0:29:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.70,0:29:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now which one of you is Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.75,0:29:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Caitlin Glass singing "Run! Run! Run!"]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=13}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=34}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
